    "content": "The Hawks say Sgt Nokuphumla Nyangwa, 48, of the Mdantsane Flying Squad, off duty, went to check on a fellow tenant at a property in Gardenia Street, Duncan Village, at about 16:30 on Sunday 11 October. An argument followed and the man allegedly stabbed her; she died. A 30-year-old man was arrested and is under police guard in hospital with knife wounds (Hawks spokesperson W/O Ndiphiwe Mhlakuvana, first reported 13 Oct). The accused is not named here.",
